Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:16.36,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 918.03 993.05 l 787.54 899.23 1059.97 894.66 1050.81 1070.85)\i1}Wealth, fame, power...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:16.45,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 503.66 1057.12 l 327.37 887.8 1089.73 892.37 1075.99 1052.54)}{\i1}Wealth, fame, power...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.45,0:02:17.99,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wealth, fame, power...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:19.49,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:22.41,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}attained this and everything else\Nthe world had to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.41,0:02:25.87,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}And his dying words drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:27.42,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.42,0:02:28.75,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:32.09,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I left everything I gathered\Ntogether in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:34.30,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.97,0:02:38.80,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}These words lured\Nmen to the Grand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:41.97,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}in pursuit of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:44.90,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}This is the time known as\Nthe Great Pirate Era!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=41}============================= OPENING NARRATION ==============================
