Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=26}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.25,0:00:20.00,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] It's enough crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.83,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And enough sitting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:26.46,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time to make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.18,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:31.34,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,They're all fighting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:35.35,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Please breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:46.65,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,You need to come back now before\Nit's too late... for your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.69,0:00:53.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] I must have been dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:57.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For a moment there, I thought\Nwe actually had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:01:01.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... So what did\Nthat shark guy just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:02.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:05.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looked like he was just\Nthrowing water around...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:08.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... but then they both started to bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.05,0:01:11.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't even have to touch you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:14.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You humans are so\Nfragile that I can kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:16.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,just by playing around\Nwith a little water...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:19.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the difference\Nbetween you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.89,0:01:21.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:29.24,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] He's not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.27,0:01:40.29,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] That's why the shark\Nis king of the fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.34,0:01:45.59,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] He's on a whole different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:47.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] You should just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your lives are not worth that much...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no one who will\Nmiss you when you're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.57,0:01:53.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:56.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY and YOSAKU]\NIt's Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.14,0:01:58.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] You're here...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:04.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ARLONG] Hey, Nami... I was just teaching one\Nfinal lesson to these pathetic little pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:07.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:14.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm here to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:09.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[ARLONG] Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:11.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You want to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:18.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs] Haven't you\Nlearned your lesson yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:23.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How many times have you tried\Nto kill me in these last eight years?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:23.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[men gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] You've tried assassination,\Npoison, sneak attacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:36.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] You must be aware that\Nyou mere humans can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.99,0:04:41.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, listen. I won't put you\Nin the ground, Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:45.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you can't leave...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:48.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You will remain here... with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:51.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... as our surveyor... forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.84,0:04:55.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, as you know,\NI'm quite good-natured.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:05:01.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If possible I'd like you to be our\Nsurveyor of your own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:02.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:08.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] I'm giving you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:11.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will not take pause in having\Nmy fishmen kill every
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:14.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,living creature on this\Nisland... except for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:17.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:19.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] But that's only if\Nyou refuse to come back
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:24.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the Arlong Pirates and draw\Nsea charts as one of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.31,0:05:27.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if you decide to come back with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.31,0:05:30.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be kind and spare\Nthe villagers their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:31.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:35.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] But, I can't let\Nthese ingrates live...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:37.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They must be made an example of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:40.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So there's only one question...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.26,0:05:43.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Will you come with me\Nand save the people
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:48.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of Cocoyashi Village,\Nor be foolish and refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:50.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,my request by fighting alongside them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:52.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:55.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With them, you will be hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:58.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With them, you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:03.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.74,0:06:07.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Will you come and stand\Nby my side... or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:12.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The decision is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.75,0:06:16.11,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] This isn't fair...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:19.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If I remain friends with Luffy and\Nthe others, everyone will be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:23.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,But if I go with Arlong, everyone\Nfrom the village will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:26.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Their lives depend on my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:30.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:33.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter what she chooses,\Nhe'll never set her free!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.67,0:06:36.67,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:42.34,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:45.05,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,450)}[NAMI] ... help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:48.10,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That's for Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:55.06,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I have to believe in him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.66,0:07:00.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Alright, everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.26,0:07:02.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll fight to the death! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.62,0:07:05.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS] Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.49,0:07:07.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS shouting]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:15.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.23,0:07:18.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like they've\Nmade up their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.22,0:07:28.68,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Please live! Please live!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:40.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:42.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.35,0:07:47.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:50.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now just remove his leg weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.29,0:07:51.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see... [grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:55.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what you meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:56.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:07:58.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:07:59.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.78,0:08:01.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.51,0:08:04.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't give up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:06.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY coughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.51,0:08:16.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Thirty seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:18.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:22.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:26.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]\NThat'll be enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:28.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] There isn't\Na fountain over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:31.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could it be that rubber man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:40.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Just stay back... you're not\Ngetting... anywhere near him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:42.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh. Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:45.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you\Nto never say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:48.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:57.42,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] If I kick and break\Nthat leg weight, he can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:09:01.90,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you're the only\None who can fight now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.49,0:09:08.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] In the sea,\None with devil fruit powers
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.59,0:09:11.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is supposed to lose even\Nthe energy to struggle,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.73,0:09:16.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,not to mention his powers. He will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:21.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if he's still alive, well,\Nthat wouldn't be fair...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.09,0:09:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You okay? Please say you're fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.47,0:09:25.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure... I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:27.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You scared us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:31.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where'd your pinwheel go? It was cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:34.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've got bigger things\Nto worry about right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:40.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO] Wouldn't be fair? This game hasn't been\Nfair from the moment we started playing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:41.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:45.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If there's a hindrance,\NI should be aware of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:46.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:47.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:49.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[USOPP] Egg Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.53,0:09:54.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] I've got your back, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.87,0:09:57.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Usopp! He's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:10:01.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How brave! And he got\Nhere just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:03.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Go on! Give it to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:05.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS] {\i1}That's{\i0} where you are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:07.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:10.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami! I beat one of their\Nleaders. Can you believe it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:13.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wiped the smug off his stupid face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:16.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Think... Is there any\Nway you can free yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:18.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope. Can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.17,0:10:20.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My energy is way too low...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.51,0:10:24.31,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Come on! Come on! Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:29.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Alright, Cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:32.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now if they can just\Nset big bro Luffy free...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.20,0:10:35.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the fishmen will be\Nrunnin' for their lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.04,0:10:36.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:39.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Take down\NArlong once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.39,0:10:42.96,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Ha, ha. Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:47.08,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to somehow prevent Arlong\Nfrom getting into the sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:49.04,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll just keep him from going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:57.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HACHI groans] I...\Nwon't let you have your way...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:10:59.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Hey, Arlong!\NI've got a present for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:01.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.88,0:11:04.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh! What's he doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:05.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's so brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.56,0:11:09.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[USOPP] Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] You seem\Nto keep standing in my way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.98,0:11:11.57,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(150,150)}Rubberband of Doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:14.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I take it you wish to die first, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:16.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:18.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:20.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, Usopp?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:24.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Now's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.57,0:11:28.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All I want is a piece\Nof that proud nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:33.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:36.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a proud nose\Nbecause it's unbreakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.61,0:11:44.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you were at full strength... you may\Nhave been able to give it a little scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:57.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:12:00.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:02.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:04.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Hmm? Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:07.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That damn octopus is up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.82,0:12:11.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:15.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HACHI] Uhh?! Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:17.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought the rubber band\Nwas gonna fly at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:18.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS] What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:22.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.01,0:12:26.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing] He saw what\NI was aiming for!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:28.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But weren't you yelling "Arlong," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:30.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO pants]\NOh, great...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:33.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HACHI] We're not done, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:36.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You may have put me down,\Nbut it wasn't for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:40.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm still alive, and now\NI'm gonna finish off your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:44.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:49.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG chuckles]\NNo need to be concerned...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:51.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,seeing as how you will\Nall be dead anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:54.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:12:59.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:01.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:13.44,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] You've done enough,\NNojiko. Leave the rest to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.16,0:13:18.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] A fishman!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:24.12,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Watch out! I'll break\Nthe rock with a kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.94,0:13:30.90,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:33.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Octopus... Fritter Frenzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:35.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:36.38,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[HACHI grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:43.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:45.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.50,0:13:51.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, that's it, huh? Way too easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:57.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] What's with all these bandages?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:13:59.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Did you have a good fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:00.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:02.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:06.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] What's this scar...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.03,0:14:08.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:11.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH crying]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.63,0:14:16.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:23.34,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ARLONG] I can't believe he's breathing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.40,0:14:26.93,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,How can he still be alive\Nwith a body like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.83,0:14:40.32,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Is he dying already...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:43.57,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Am I fighting a wounded man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:49.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Either way, he's about to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:53.29,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He's going to die right here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.79,0:14:56.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:57.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.72,0:14:59.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.32,0:15:05.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] If a person stays put...\Ntheir wounds won't open up...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:10.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Is that right? Do you\Nfind your situation amusing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:13.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.81,0:15:16.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] I'm not talking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.39,0:15:18.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the Octo-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:21.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.23,0:15:26.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] I thought I told you.\NWe'll win this game!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:29.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HACHI groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:37.83,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] That was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.78,0:15:47.76,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] {\i1}You're{\i0} the one that made this\Ncomplicated in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:51.55,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.55,0:15:54.25,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] It's time\Nto take care of that shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:15:57.02,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:59.10,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:00.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did they free you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.23,0:16:03.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:07.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:15.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] I'm back! Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:17.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS cheering]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:18.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:21.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our hero's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:25.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP cheers]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:29.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps] Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.49,0:16:35.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] That rubber bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:38.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're... a bit late...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:39.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:41.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:42.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.31,0:16:46.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hold on... what're you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.11,0:16:48.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:50.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.29,0:16:52.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.07,0:16:54.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:56.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL] You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:16:59.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY] Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:02.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.13,0:17:03.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:05.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:07.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.09,0:17:14.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY] Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:16.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.52,0:17:21.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gatling!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:32.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.45,0:17:39.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:51.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Is that all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.89,0:17:54.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:57.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope. Just a warm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.15,0:18:01.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groans]\NThat idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.73,0:18:02.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.94,0:18:05.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:09.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] What a bunch of fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:11.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think you can actually beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.43,0:18:14.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were better off drowning\Non the ocean floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:16.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:17.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I like it up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.76,0:18:20.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.53,0:18:26.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you not understand my anger?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:31.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I saw my brothers crushed like worms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:37.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ARLONG] You'll realize soon enough that you\Nshould've quite fighting a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think Luffy's gonna be ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:43.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean Arlong doesn't seem to be\Naffected by his attacks at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.59,0:18:47.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And more importantly, just how\Nfar away do you think Zoro flew?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:50.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! I've got your back, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:52.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.74,0:19:03.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] If he loses...\Nthen we'll all... die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:05.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Yeah. We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.07,0:19:10.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] If that happens, it's\Nthe end of the East Blue, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:16.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know what the biggest difference
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.12,0:19:20.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,between you and me is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:22.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:24.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The jaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:28.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Umm...? What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.72,0:19:33.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uhh... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.31,0:19:34.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Webbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:37.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG growls]\NSpecies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.95,0:19:40.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.29,0:19:44.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:47.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:48.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:49.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.33,0:19:50.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, man! I bet that had to be painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.72,0:19:55.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His teeth must be shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.97,0:19:59.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:01.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.89,0:20:05.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] He bit\Nthrough that stone pillar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:07.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:09.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:23.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] You see? This is\Nthe inherent power of fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:28.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you humans having\Nbeen created with such limited power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.32,0:20:32.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've been on a different level\Nsince the beginning of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:32.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are inferior.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.95,0:20:36.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It only makes sense for\Nyou to bow before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.64,0:20:47.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's right. There's no\Nway a human could do
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.81,0:20:51.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,something like that. If those\Njaws got a hold of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:55.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they would do a lot more than\Njust leave some bite marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.73,0:21:00.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:04.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'll snap through your\Nbones like a butcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.53,0:21:06.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:10.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Yeah, so what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.35,0:21:11.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit your braggin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:15.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] You're not that awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:18.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.44,0:21:21.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Besides, smashing stones with\Nyour teeth isn't that smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:28.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Way to go! You're the\Nbest Big Bro! Tell it like is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:31.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Yeah! What idiot\Nbites a rock anyway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:35.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fools... That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.88,0:21:38.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every member of the human race\Nis ignorant and weak...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:43.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What good are you if you can't even\Npull yourself out of the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.98,0:21:51.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, I'm worthless\Nwithout my friends to help me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:54.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:56.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.11,0:21:58.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? No way... Luffy's a swordsman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.84,0:22:02.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.18,0:22:03.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Take that! And that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.89,0:22:04.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.88,0:22:07.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it isn't swordplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:10.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're just flailing about\Nlike a child playing pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.21,0:22:20.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope you realize this isn't a game...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.86,0:22:24.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.25,0:22:33.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's enough... Now, die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.36,0:22:35.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Shut your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:36.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.46,0:22:38.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.10,0:22:52.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.09,0:22:57.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS] What?! He just\Nshattered Arlong's teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.98,0:23:00.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.60,0:23:03.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.77,0:23:06.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have a clue how to\Nuse a sword, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.94,0:23:09.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait... What exactly is\Nhe trying to say here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.95,0:23:11.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.15,0:23:19.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] I'm a terrible sailor...\NI definitely can't cook...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.20,0:23:22.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... and I can't even lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.07,0:23:23.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.71,0:23:28.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And without my friends to help me,\NI would have been dead a long time ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.21,0:23:34.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG laughs] So you fully\Nadmit how pathetic you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.15,0:23:37.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You may be a fool, but you\Ncertainly are honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.55,0:23:42.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How must your crew feel, tolerating\Nthis idiocy day in and day out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.50,0:23:45.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I bet they're sick of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.47,0:23:51.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But that makes me wonder why they tried so\Ndesperately to save their halfwit leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.68,0:23:55.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone like you doesn't\Ndeserve a ship or a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.25,0:23:58.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What good is a helpless,\Nrubber-brained captain to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.29,0:24:00.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What can you possibly do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.22,0:24:02.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.09,0:24:08.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well get to it. Ya numbskull.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.17,0:24:11.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If he dies I'm gonna kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.43,0:24:14.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Heh, heh, heh.\NI've got your back, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.36,0:24:16.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Alright, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.60,0:24:18.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Get him Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:21.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Yeah! Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.11,0:24:24.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cheer all you want, but\Nit won't change a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.00,0:24:28.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh! He's got new teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.62,0:24:30.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] I'm a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.29,0:24:32.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,New teeth will grow, one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.62,0:24:38.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And with each set they become\Nstronger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.70,0:24:40.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Endlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.08,0:24:45.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.78,0:24:48.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As many as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.93,0:24:52.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.49,0:24:59.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is but one of the many\Ngifts we fishmen possess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.16,0:25:02.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.40,0:25:08.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you haven't yet realized that fishmen\Nare superior, you will very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.68,0:25:15.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Tooth... Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.33,0:25:16.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.33,0:25:19.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelping]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.21,0:25:23.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.17,0:25:27.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [ARLONG laughs]\N– [LUFFY screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.05,0:25:33.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] Big Bro Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.60,0:25:36.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.39,0:25:38.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.68,0:25:41.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.77,0:25:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN F] Arlong... Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.23,0:25:46.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.46,0:25:48.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What...? My brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.49,0:25:51.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN F groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.28,0:25:52.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.66,0:25:56.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] You're dead...\NYou stretchy freak...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.74,0:26:00.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you use my injured\Nbrother as a shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.65,0:26:01.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.78,0:26:04.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're the one who attacked me,\Ndon't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.75,0:26:06.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs] That was pretty scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.05,0:26:15.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't move a muscle... Rubber man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.95,0:26:19.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. Hey. Now that's\Nan interesting idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.46,0:26:20.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's got an idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.56,0:26:23.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's in his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.46,0:26:25.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did he come up with some secret scheme?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.52,0:26:28.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[ARLONG groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.46,0:26:28.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ARLONG] Tooth attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.69,0:26:29.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.94,0:26:33.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [ARLONG yells]\N– [LUFFY groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.74,0:26:36.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.91,0:26:39.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[ARLONG groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.30,0:26:54.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.23,0:26:58.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] You...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.59,0:27:02.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fool. There's no point\Nin crushing my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.07,0:27:05.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You really don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.60,0:27:11.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Luffy, uh, that\Ncan't be very sanitary...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.94,0:27:14.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what?! Now I have shark teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.40,0:27:18.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.32,0:27:22.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really, what were they\Nexpecting? It's Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.82,0:27:29.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] How long do you intend\Nto keep fooling around?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.14,0:27:36.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY screaming]\NA shark bit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.11,0:27:39.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH] So stop playin' games!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.61,0:27:42.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well it's not like I'm having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.78,0:27:44.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ARLONG] Tooth attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.18,0:27:44.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.61,0:27:52.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.65,0:28:01.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG yells, chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.54,0:28:06.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.87,0:28:09.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.59,0:28:20.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gotcha! And now we're even. [laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.50,0:28:24.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you used my teeth... [grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.93,0:28:28.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... Your puny jaws\Naren't strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.97,0:28:33.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now listen... Sharp as my teeth are,\Nthey're only useful when they come
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.47,0:28:35.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with powerful jaws like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.61,0:28:37.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then they're deadly!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.36,0:28:38.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.85,0:28:43.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Big Bro's gonna\Nget his arm bitten off!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.08,0:28:44.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.37,0:28:51.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Caitlin Glass singing "Run! Run! Run!"]
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=27}===============================DIALOGUE============================
